message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
title: "Brazilian Port Digital Transformation Observatory: Port Digitalization, Efficiency and Trade Costs"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Gregory"
    given-names: "Valber"
    email: "valber.gregory@gmail.com"
abstract: >
  Research compendium and information system integrating Brazilian port
  operations (ANTAQ), foreign trade (Comex Stat) and a curated registry of
  port digitalization interventions, used to estimate the causal effects of
  digitalization on vessel waiting times, technical efficiency and trade.
keywords:
  - port digitalization
  - maritime economics
  - trade costs
  - stochastic frontier
  - difference-in-differences
  - information systems
license: MIT
version: "0.0.1"
date-released: "2026-09-03"
